# Build-time config for the production bundle. Committed on purpose: nothing
# here is a secret — it is a public origin that appears in every image URL.
#
# This one value switches src/cloud/media.ts from the inline base64 fallback
# to real uploads. If it is ever unset, avatars quietly go back to 12 kB data
# URIs and covers refuse — the app degrades rather than breaking.
#
# It must stay in step with mediaPrefix()/mediaPrefixLen() in firestore.rules:
# the rules reject any picture URL that is not on this exact origin, so a
# mismatch fails closed (every upload saves but no profile write is accepted).
VITE_MEDIA_ORIGIN=https://remi-share.sheepdeklerk.workers.dev
